Summer Engine 3D RPG Template

This template's source code (script files, scene files, shaders, and generally all
Summer Engine-generated resources) is available under the MIT license.
Art assets (image textures and 3D models) are CC-By 4.0.

In short, you can reuse code and art assets in your own projects freely, including
commercial ones, as long as you give credit where due.

For assets, you can add this to your credits:
"Additional assets CC-By 4.0 GDQuest (https://www.gdquest.com/)".

For code, you can add this to your credits:
"Portions of this project use code from GDQuest (https://www.gdquest.com/) licensed under MIT".

It really helps when you credit creators, so thank you in advance!

The above is for clarity. The exact terms of the MIT license follow below.

